    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūbabala bashilikale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ū Shetani ūbapelanīla a Baisilaeli gīkī abīītīle yabūbi, hūna ūnsamīlīja ū Daūdi kūbabala a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Yoabu na a bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale abo walī nabo; ūhaya gīkī, “Jagi mukababale a Baisilaeli, kwandīja Beeli-sheba kūshisha Dani, hanuma munehele ī lishosho, nabūmane ū wingī wabo ūmo būlī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yoabu ūnshokeja ū ntemi gīkī, “Ū SEEBA ni abongejage a bashilikale ng'hangala magana na magana. Baba būgonzo ntemi, a bose benabo batī batūmami ba ng'wa baba būgonzo ū ntemi? Nibūlī ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi alīīta mhayo gūlī gīko? Mhayo kī ūyo gūlenheleja nose ū baba būgonzo abingīje mu kwihīga a Baisilaeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi ūtūmamīla nguzu ū mu kūng'wīla ū Yoabu; na lūūlū ū Yoabu wīnga, ūja pye a hose ū mu sī ya Isilaeli; ūūkashoka hangī ī Yeluslemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoabu ūng'wenhela ū Daūdi ī lisaabu lya bashilikale: ū mu Isilaeli ī yose baalīmo bashilikale milyoni īmò na shihūmbī igana, abo baalī badūgije kūdima shū mu būlūgū; ū mu sī ya Yuda baalīmo shihūmbī magana anè na makūmi mpungatī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yoabu atababalile a ba lūganda lwa ng'wa Lawī nū lwa ng'wa Benjamini; nguno ī shilagīlo sha ntemi shaalī shabūbi no ū kūlī wei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūbūloleela būhūbi wakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ī shilagīlo shenīshi shaalī shabūbi nū mu miso ga ng'wa Mulungu, na lūūlū ūbagwisīja nsango a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Mulungu gīkī, “Naahūbile no ū kwīta ū mhayo gwenūyo. Nalīkwikūmbīlīja ūwīnje ū būkenaagūji wa ntūmami wako; nīītile mhayo gwa nyachilū-chilū no!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla Gadi ūyo walī ng'hangi wa ng'wa Daūdi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jaga ūkang'wīle ū Daūdi, ‘Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī: Nalīkwinha mihayo īdatū ūsole gūmò gwaho, ūniwīle nakwītīle īyo natogilwe kūkwītīla.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Gadi ūja ū kūlī Daūdi ūkang'wīla, “Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Isolelage bebe ng'wenekīlī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "myaka īdatū ya nzala, nūūlū banishi bako bakwiboneele mu nzīla ya būlūgū ikanza lya myeji īdatū, nūūlū lūshū lwa ng'wa SEEBA lwīkenaagūle ī sī yako ikanza lya shikū idatū; hū kūhaya līgwe ihuuya na malaika wa ng'wa SEEBA abīte pye a hose aje akwīkenaagūlaga ī sī ya Isilseli!’ Ali lūūlū, iganikage ūninhe ū būlamuji wako nakang'winhe ī lishosho ūyo wanitūmaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūshosha alīhaya, “Nalī mu makoye madito no ī haha; hambū-hambū nagwe mu makono ga ng'wa SEEBA, nguno ū ng'wene ī shigongo shakwe shilī shitaale no. Yaya ū kūnileka nagwe mu makono ga banhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūtūma ihūūya ū mu sī ya Isilaeli, būgwa bagosha shihūmbī makūmi mpungatī ba mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūntūma malaika kwīkenaagūla nī Yelusalemu, alīyo aho wandya ū malaika, ū SEEBA ūbūbona ū būkenaagūji wenūbo, ūsaatwa no. Ūng'wīla ū malaika ūyo wabayagajaga a banhū gīkī, “Wigejaga lūūlū! Gwichage ū nkono gwako.” Ī likanza lyenīlo ū malaika akasangwa wīmīīlaga ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla, lwa ng'wa Alauna ūmò wa Bayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi aho wabūūcha a miso ūmona ū malaika wa ng'wa SEEBA īmīīlile higūlya, atapandile a hasī; kūnū adimīlile līlūshū mu nkono gūgoloolilwe higūlya ya Yelusalemu. A henaho ū Daūdi na a banamhala ba Yelusalemu būgwa ha sī bachimīgije; a bose baalī bazwalile shizwalo sha magūnīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Mulungu, “Naalī natī nene ūyo naalī nalagīgije gīkī babalwe a bashilikale? Ū nene hū nalī ng'hūbi, hū nene nalī nkenaagūji! A banhū bene balī ng'holo jako dūhū, a bene bīītile mhayo kī? Ee SEEBA Mulungu wane, ū nkono gwako ni gūnigwīlage nene hamò na kaya yane. Ī lihūūya ni lītizagūbamala a banhū bako!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūzenga ng'walīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū malaika wa ng'wa SEEBA ūnagīja ū Gadi akang'wīle ū Daūdi aje akanzegele ū SEEBA ng'walīlo a ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla lwa ng'wa Alauna ū Nyebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nghana ū Daūdi ūja gīt'ūmo SEEBA akalagīīlīla mu nzīla ya ng'wa Gadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alauna watūlaga ngano jakwe, aho wabūūcha a miso ūmona ū malaika; walī na bitūnja bakwe banè būpeela būūkibisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna nū Daūdi wiza, ū Alauna aho wamona aliza, wīnga a ha lūbūūga winama ha sī ū būshū wakwe ū kū būtongi wa ng'wa Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūhaya, “Nizunīlījage nalīsole ī libbaala lyenīlī aho lūlī lūbūūga lwako lwa kūtūlīla, nalītūmamīle kūzenga hoi ng'walīlo kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, līhangījiwe ī lihūūya ū kū banhū. Nijingījage ūmo gūlī ū mpango gwalyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Alauna ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Līsolage dūhū! Ū baba būgonzo ū ntemi ni ītage gīt'ūmo atogelilwe. Jiiji nī nzīkū najifunyaga kūlwa shakwinha sha kūpemva, a matūlīlo ga būsīga gakūbiza ng'hwi ja kūpemba, ī ngano jikūtūmama kūlwa shakwinha sha būsu; ī shose shenīshi nashifunyaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi Daūdi ūnshokeja ū Alauna gīkī, “Yaya ītī gīko, ū nene nalītogwa kūshifunīja ū mpango gwasho gete. Natīko kūshisola ī shikolo shako kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA; nūūlū natīko kūfunya shitambo shikolo sha kwinhwa dalali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Dūadi ūng'winha ū Alauna kilo mpungatī ja zahabu kūlwa ipandī lyenīlo, aho lwalī ū lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūzenga ho ng'walīlo kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA, ūfunya shakwinha sha kūpemva na shakwinha sha būsangī. Ūnīlīīla ū SEEBA, ū SEEBA nang'hwe ūng'widīka mu nzīla ya moto kūfuma ng'wigūlū a ha ng'walīlo gwa shitambo sha kūpemva henaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū malaika, nang'hwe ū malaika ūlīshosha ī līlūshū mu shilaalo shaalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Daūdi aho wabona gīkī ū SEEBA wang'widīka a ha lūbūūga lwa kūtūlīla būsīga lwa ng'wa Alauna ū Nyebusi, ū Daūdi ūfunya hoi shitambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo ī liheema lya ng'wa SEEBA īlo Musa walī walībeeja kwitogolo lyalī lītaalī kwipandī lya higūlya lya Gibeoni; pyī nū ng'walīlo gwa shakwinha sha kūpemva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Daūdi atagimile ū kwegeela hoi ū kūmūja ū SEEBA, kūlwa nguno ya kūlyogoha ī līlūshū lya ng'wa malaika wa ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.30"
            ]
          }
        }
